Etterna/ mirrors the upstream src/Etterna layout, so the calculator's own
relative includes work unchanged:

  Etterna/MinaCalc/                     src/Etterna/MinaCalc/ (without CMakeLists.txt)
  Etterna/Models/NoteData/NoteDataStructures.h
                                        src/Etterna/Models/NoteData/NoteDataStructures.h

The files are as upstream except for one change, which upstream needs to build
with STANDALONE_CALC at all: the call to load_calc_params_from_disk() in
Calc::InitializeHands is only compiled into the game, like the function it
calls.  It runs only in debug mode, which nothing here uses.

--- src/Etterna/MinaCalc/MinaCalc.cpp
+++ Etterna/MinaCalc/MinaCalc.cpp
@@ -545,7 +545,9 @@
 	// if debug, force params to load and reset pmods and base diffs
 	if (debugmode || loadparams) {
+#if !defined(STANDALONE_CALC) && !defined(PHPCALC)
 		ulbu_in_charge->load_calc_params_from_disk(true);
+#endif
 		for (const auto& hand : both_hands) {

sse2neon/ is Etterna's extern/sse2neon/sse2neon (sse2neon v1.7.0,
https://github.com/DLTcollab/sse2neon, MIT, see sse2neon/LICENSE), unchanged.
The calc includes it instead of <xmmintrin.h> on 64-bit ARM.

minacalc_c.h and minacalc_c.cpp are ours: a C interface for the game (C++03)
and the online server (Go, through cgo).

To update: copy the two upstream paths over Etterna/, delete the
CMakeLists.txt files, reapply the change above if it is still needed, and
update the commit and calc version here.
